confirmer_changement_de_compte.description:
The authorization you just granted is for a different account than the one the destination “{destination}” uses.

Previous account: {ancien_compte}
New account: {nouveau_compte}

If you confirm, the destination will send backups to the new account from now on. Backups already stored on the previous account will no longer be listed or purged by Auto Backup: they stay with the provider, for you to manage.

Without confirmation nothing is saved: the destination keeps its account and its previous authorization.

confirmer_changement_de_dossier.description:
You are about to change the remote folder of the destination “{destination}”.

Current folder: {ancien_dossier}
New folder: {nouveau_dossier}

If you confirm, the next backups will be uploaded to the new folder. Backups already in the previous folder will no longer be listed or purged by Auto Backup: they stay with the provider, for you to move or delete.

Without confirmation nothing is saved: the destination keeps all its previous settings.
